  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building localization and resilience for the Women Peace and Security (WPS) Agenda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen the localization and resilience of the WPS agenda in Ethiopia by empowering local actors, enhancing institutional capacities, and by contributing to fostering sustainable and inclusive peace processes that ensure the active meaningful participation and leadership of women in conflict its mitigation, prevention, transformative resolution, and post-conflict recovery.</narrative>
  </description>
